-- Studio Morgana brand guide: one page. Deep colours, three typefaces, imagery, the wordmark on dark and light.
-- Laid out with words: a margin, text styles, things placed under other things. Only the cover and the swatches
-- are given positions; everything else follows them.
Let there be a flat canvas called brand-guide, 1600 by 2400.
Let the margin be 120.
Let text be in Jost, size 26, aligned left.
Let a heading be Martian Mono, size 26, tracking 6, brass.
Let a note be leading 1.4, bone, 40% see-through.
Let ink be #0b0b10.
Let bone be #efe6d8.
Let brass be #c19a4b.
Make the card ink, grainy 0.12.

-- the cover band
Let there be a rectangle called cover, 1600 by 760, at 800 380.
Print @tiara-night.jpg in the cover, duotone #0b0b10 and #6e1a2e, focused at 0.5 0.3.
Give the cover a vignette of 0.6, in #0b0b10.
Write "Deep colour, sharp type, real light." called promise in Jost light, size 40, in the cover, at the bottom left, 120 in.
Write "BRAND GUIDE · EDITION ONE · 2026" called kicker in Martian Mono, tracking 6, above the promise, 24 apart.
Write "Morgana" called wordmark in Bodoni Moda italic, fit 900, above the kicker, 30 apart.
Make the wordmark bone, shadowed, 12 down, blur 30, 50% opacity.
Make the kicker brass.
Make the promise bone, 25% see-through.

-- 01 colour
Write "01  COLOUR" called h-colour as a heading, under the cover, 110 apart.
Let there be 6 rectangles called swatch, 210 by 300, corners 24, in a row, 236 apart, under the h-colour, 40 apart.
Make the first swatch #4a0e1c.
Make the second swatch #0d1033.
Make the third swatch #0f3b2e.
Make the fourth swatch #2b0f2e.
Make the fifth swatch brass.
Make the sixth swatch bone.
Give the swatches an outline in #ffffff, 1 wide, 88% see-through.
Write "Oxblood\n#4A0E1C", "Midnight\n#0D1033", "Forest\n#0F3B2E", "Aubergine\n#2B0F2E", "Brass\n#C19A4B", "Bone\n#EFE6D8" in each swatch, at the bottom left, 20 in.
Make the swatch-labels readable, bone or ink.

-- 02 type
Write "02  TYPE" called h-type as a heading, under the swatches, 110 apart.
Write "Aa" called aa-display in Bodoni Moda italic, size 190, under the h-type, 40 apart.
Write "Aa" called aa-body in Jost, size 190, beside the aa-display, 300 apart.
Write "Aa" called aa-mono in Martian Mono, size 150, beside the aa-body, 300 apart.
Make the aa-display and the aa-body bone.
Make the aa-mono brass.
Write "Bodoni Moda\nDisplay · headlines", "Jost\nBody · interface", "Martian Mono\nCode · labels · data" as a note, called type-note, under the aa-display, the aa-body and the aa-mono, 30 apart.

-- 03 imagery
Write "03  IMAGERY" called h-image as a heading, under the type-notes, 100 apart.
Let there be 3 rectangles called img, 440 by 380, corners 28, in a row, 460 apart, under the h-image, 40 apart.
Print @hallows.jpg in the first img, focused at 0.3 0.4.
Print @sienna-shoreline.jpg in the second img, duotone #0d1033 and #efe6d8, focused at 0.5 0.45.
Print @tiara-night.jpg in the third img, grayscale, contrast 1.2, focused at 0.5 0.25.
Give the imgs a shadow, 18 down, blur 40, 60% opacity.

Write "Low light. Warm skin. One colour leads." called rule, size 30, under the imgs, 50 apart.
Write "studiomorgana.xyz" called url in Martian Mono, size 24, under the third img, 50 apart, lined up on the right.
Make the rule bone.
Make the url brass.
